## Shrink the README logo
================================================================================

Context: The README used a bare Markdown image for the OntoBricks SVG. GitHub
and the preview render that at the SVG's full display size, so the icon
dominated the header. HTML `<img>` is required to set an explicit pixel size.

Changes:

1. README.md
   Render the logo as a centered 72×72 HTML image.

Modified files:
- README.md
- changelogs/v0.9.1/benoitcayladbx_2026-10-29.log

